{"id":"621985f38a386342","group":"58","path":"58/batch01/58-df-subformula.md","title":"Subformula","display":"df-subformula — Subformula","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-subformula","aliases":["58-df-subformula"],"display":"df-subformula — Subformula","depends_on":["[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]","[[../batch06/58-df-atomic-formula.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-subformula"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-subformula</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-subformula — Subformula"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ca5c1762b574813b\" href=\"?note=ca5c1762b574813b\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-atomic-formula.md\">../batch06/58-df-atomic-formula.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma,\\varphi\\in V\">\\(\\Sigma,\\varphi\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\)</span> (first-order-formula set; see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AtFml}_S(\\Sigma)\">\\(\\mathrm{AtFml}_S(\\Sigma)\\)</span> (atomic-formula set; see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ca5c1762b574813b\" href=\"?note=ca5c1762b574813b\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-atomic-formula.md\">../batch06/58-df-atomic-formula.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sf}_\\Sigma\">\\(\\mathrm{Sf}_\\Sigma\\)</span> (subformula-set operator defined here by structural recursion)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SubformulaClosed}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{SubformulaClosed}_S\\)</span> (downward-constructor-closed family predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}subformula\\text{-}closed}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{SubformulaClosed}_S(C,\\Sigma)\\leftrightarrow\nC\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\;\n(\\neg\\psi\\in C\\to\\psi\\in C)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall\\psi,\\chi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\;\n((\\psi\\lor\\chi)\\in C\\to\\psi\\in C\\land\\chi\\in C)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\;\\forall\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\;\n((\\forall x\\,\\psi)\\in C\\to\\psi\\in C).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}subformula\\text{-}closed}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{SubformulaClosed}_S(C,\\Sigma)\\leftrightarrow\nC\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\;\n(\\neg\\psi\\in C\\to\\psi\\in C)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall\\psi,\\chi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\;\n((\\psi\\lor\\chi)\\in C\\to\\psi\\in C\\land\\chi\\in C)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\;\\forall\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\;\n((\\forall x\\,\\psi)\\in C\\to\\psi\\in C).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}subformula} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Sf}_\\Sigma(\\varphi)\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\n\\displaystyle\\bigcap\\{C\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\mid\n\\varphi\\in C\\land\\mathrm{SubformulaClosed}_S(C,\\Sigma)\\},\n&amp;\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma),\\\\[1ex]\n\\varnothing,&amp;\\varphi\\notin\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma).\n\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}subformula} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Sf}_\\Sigma(\\varphi)\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\n\\displaystyle\\bigcap\\{C\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\mid\n\\varphi\\in C\\land\\mathrm{SubformulaClosed}_S(C,\\Sigma)\\},\n&amp;\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma),\\\\[1ex]\n\\varnothing,&amp;\\varphi\\notin\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma).\n\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>子公式关系 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Sf}_\\Sigma(\\varphi)\">\\(\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Sf}_\\Sigma(\\varphi)\\)</span> 表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\psi\">\\(\\psi\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span> 的子公式</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sf}_\\Sigma(\\varphi)\">\\(\\mathrm{Sf}_\\Sigma(\\varphi)\\)</span> 包含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span> 自身及其所有直接和间接的子公式</li>\n<li>The intersection definition is the least formula family containing <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span> and closed downward under every constructor; all decomposition variables are locally quantified rather than leaked as global parameters.</li>\n<li>子公式概念在有界量词定义中用于检查是否所有量词都是有界的</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Related-Concepts\">[Related Concepts]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a> — 一阶公式</li>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"ca5c1762b574813b\" href=\"?note=ca5c1762b574813b\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-atomic-formula.md\">../batch06/58-df-atomic-formula.md</a> — 原子公式</li>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"44ad6dc46f3340f0\" href=\"?note=44ad6dc46f3340f0\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-bound-variable.md\">../batch19/58-df-bound-variable.md</a> — 约束变元</li>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"715a32e91161b34f\" href=\"?note=715a32e91161b34f\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md\">../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md</a> — 自由变元</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Related-Concepts","text":"[Related Concepts]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch17/58-df-formula.md","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch06/58-df-atomic-formula.md","status":"resolved","id":"ca5c1762b574813b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-atomic-formula.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-formula.md","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)$ (first-order-formula set; see [[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch06/58-df-atomic-formula.md","status":"resolved","id":"ca5c1762b574813b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{AtFml}_S(\\Sigma)$ (atomic-formula set; see [[../batch06/58-df-atomic-formula.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-formula.md","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Related Concepts]","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]] — 一阶公式","embed":false},{"target":"../batch06/58-df-atomic-formula.md","status":"reso